/*
 * FP Corne based on frozen Sofle v08 - candidate v02 - 2026-10-23.
 * NOT COMPILED OR FLASHED. Review before integration into the existing ZMK v0.3 project.
 * Changes vs v01: see LEIA-ME_v02.md. Generated from FP_Corne_Sofle_v08_Candidato_v02.json.
